e, some were used as a transporter, but mostly as trainers which became its most successful role. The aircraft was  very suitable to use in preparing pilots in flying multi engine bombers, such as the Avro Lancaster.","LocalizedString":"The Avro Anson was a British twin engined aircraft used in various roles during WWII by RAF, and other Allied air forces. The aircraft was initially developed for maritime reconnaissance, but at the outbreak of war it had been realized that it had limited capabilities for this role and was replaced with the American Lockheed Hudson. The Avro Anson was after that pulled from front line service, some were used as a transporter, but mostly as trainers which became its most successful role. The aircraft was  very suitable to use in preparing pilots in flying multi engine bombers, such as the Avro Lancaster."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardAttacks"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_depl_biplane_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_depl_biplane_Cue.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_move_biplane_01_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_move_biplane_01_Cue.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_move_biplane_01_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_move_biplane_01_Cue.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Aircraft_Small_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Aircraft_Small_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/Breakthrough/t_avro_anson.t_avro_anson","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Bot","artist":"Marii Chernev","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/AVRO_ANSON.AVRO_ANSON","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSi